@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Guide (日本語)" as Guide
actor "User (English)" as EnUser

rectangle "AWS Cloud" {
  [API Gateway\n(WebSocket API)]
  [Lambda: $connect/$disconnect]
  [Lambda: distributor]
  [DynamoDB\nConnections]
  [AWS Polly]
}

Guide --> [AWS Polly] : 音声テキスト送信（EN）
[AWS Polly] --> [Lambda: distributor] : 音声（Base64）生成完了

EnUser --> [API Gateway\n(WebSocket API)] : 接続 (wss://...)
[API Gateway\n(WebSocket API)] --> [Lambda: $connect/$disconnect] : connectionId登録
[Lambda: $connect/$disconnect] --> [DynamoDB\nConnections]

[Lambda: distributor] --> [DynamoDB\nConnections] : 全接続ID取得
[Lambda: distributor] --> [API Gateway\n(WebSocket API)] : postToConnection\n(音声配信)

[API Gateway\n(WebSocket API)] --> EnUser : 音声データ送信
@enduml
